==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hajime Saito (Enemy)|Hajime Saito]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] are recommended for this stage. First grind some money for Bahamut Cat, B.B. Bunny isn't a serious threat to your base, so you can let it continously attack without worry. Once Bahamut Cat is on the field, spam [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cats]] to tank for Bahamut Cat, and use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] as a secondary attacker. Once you hit the base, the boss wave and enemy spawn keeps Bahamut Cat safe from Hajime, while Hajime's own strikes give both Paris and Artist openings to hit him, this, coupled with his high knockback count means you can stunlock him efficiently. St. Pigge the 2nd is not a threat here.

